00&blur=200&s=2163bd1be5381a7244f85f0c1b2ae5cc 3x"}, "body": "hi I wish to get a art piece of this character she is 29 years old and stands at 195 centimeters tall. Before becoming a soldier in the organization, she was a personal knight of a queen in a certain country and also a member of an organization responsible for secretly assassinating those who posed a threat to the monarchy. She is skilled in sniping, works efficiently and never questions her superiors' orders. During a premeditated coup, she was forced to flee the country, abandoning her former sense of justice and honor to ease her inner pain. Her expression is almost always a constant smile, as this makes her seem less dangerous and lowers others' guard. Only in some special circumstances will her expression change slightly. She is also usually a narrow-eyed character, and her eyes only open wide when she is extremely angry or sad.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1_etJZBvhYZdSjcAjYm88lphP8hjG2NFt/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@TmBR117/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1799135, "client_id": 2987383, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a41d1f6/uploads/origins/81b5c744-02bd-4489-a800-d30c0e93aafb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5f0dba319543840a0b3fea6faa1395e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7a41d1f6/uploads/origins/81b5c744-02bd-4489-a800-d30c0e93aafb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5f0dba319543840a0b3fea6faa1395e, https://si.imgix.net/7a41d1f6/uploads/origins/81b5c744-02bd-4489-a800-d30c0e93aafb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9436557513cc1408d8aa0e457d6e93f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7a41d1f6/uploads/origins/81b5c744-02bd-4489-a800-d30c0e93aafb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Cc